Individual messages

Usage:
  proton mail messages <command>

Commands:
  attachments  Files attached to a message
  delete       Delete messages permanently
  empty        Delete everything in a folder, permanently
  expire       Make messages delete themselves after a while
  export       Write messages out as .eml or mbox files
  forward      Forward a message
  get          Show one message, decrypted
  label        Attach a label to messages
  list         List messages in a folder
  mark         Set whether messages count as read
  move         Move messages to a folder
  reply        Reply to a message
  send         Compose and send a message
  star         Star messages
  trash        Move messages to the trash
  unlabel      Detach a label from messages
  unschedule   Cancel a scheduled send, returning the message to drafts
  unstar       Remove the star from messages
  unsubscribe  Ask a mailing list to stop
  watch        Print each message as it arrives

Global flags:    proton --help
Full reference:  https://proton-cli.lerchster.dev/mail/messages/
